Scoped Lego Mindstorms RSO header and payload semantics

The header layout, codec tag table, header refusals, informational size field
and read-to-EOF payload in src/rso.ts follow libavformat/rsodec.c
(rso_read_header), rsoenc.c (rso_write_header, rso_write_trailer), rso.c
(ff_codec_rso_tags), rso.h (RSO_HEADER_SIZE) and pcm.c (ff_pcm_read_packet,
ff_pcm_default_packet_size, ff_pcm_read_seek).
